{"5003700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Midnight Class", "steam_appid": 5003700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MIDNIGHT CLASS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evening class has begun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The school is so quiet. The classrooms are too familiar. Everything seems to be exactly normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least, for now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move through the school, something begins to feel wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A familiar classroom has changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is missing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is where it should not be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5003700/extras/825933716f71b60fc344b95dc783e573.avif?t=1787206611\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find the anomaly.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then decide <strong>which way to go</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OBSERVE. REMEMBER. CHOOSE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Midnight Class</i>, your surroundings are constantly changing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you encounter an anomaly, you must carefully observe the environment and decide how to proceed. Choose the correct path and continue deeper into the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the wrong choice, and you will be sent back to where the journey began.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The school is a maze of familiar places that refuse to remain the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clock keeps moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FROM EVENING STUDY TO MIDNIGHT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At 7:20 PM, evening study begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the hours pass, the familiar school gradually becomes something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At midnight, every light goes out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the night is not over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must continue exploring through the darkness until 6:00 AM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only then can you hope to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there is still a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A STORY HIDDEN IN THE ANOMALIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The strange things you encounter are not random.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the school, you will begin to witness fragments of another story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series of memories that should have been forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the school remembers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classrooms remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And perhaps, someone is still waiting for you to remember too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5003700/extras/e594977f9235b8bed022f3333c8d59a0.avif?t=1787206611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5003700/extras_big/e594977f9235b8bed022f3333c8d59a0.avif?t=1787206611 width=1560 height=1082 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explore a mysterious school through a first-person perspective</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Carefully observe your surroundings and identify anomalies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Make decisions based on what has changed — and what should not have changed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Choose the correct path to continue your journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Make the wrong choice and return to the beginning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Experience a night class that progresses from 7:20 PM to 6:00 AM</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explore the darkness after every light in the school goes out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Uncover the story of a girl through fragments of the past</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Experience an atmospheric psychological horror story about memory, bullying, and the things that refuse to disappear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5003700/extras/8ba1af6aab9ee9e2cfea16a6b7d319aa.avif?t=1787206611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5003700/extras_big/8ba1af6aab9ee9e2cfea16a6b7d319aa.avif?t=1787206611 width=1560 height=898 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE NIGHT IS NOT OVER.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's 7:20 PM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Class is about to begin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At midnight, the lights will go out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At 6:00 AM, the night should finally be over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So why are you still here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you finally make it out...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Are you sure you <strong>really escaped</strong>?..</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MIDNIGHT CLASS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evening class has begun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The school is so quiet. The classrooms are too familiar. Everything seems to be exactly normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least, for now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move through the school, something begins to feel wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A familiar classroom has changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is missing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is where it should not be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5003700/extras/825933716f71b60fc344b95dc783e573.avif?t=1787206611\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find the anomaly.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then decide <strong>which way to go</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OBSERVE. REMEMBER. CHOOSE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Midnight Class</i>, your surroundings are constantly changing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you encounter an anomaly, you must carefully observe the environment and decide how to proceed. Choose the correct path and continue deeper into the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the wrong choice, and you will be sent back to where the journey began.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The school is a maze of familiar places that refuse to remain the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clock keeps moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FROM EVENING STUDY TO MIDNIGHT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At 7:20 PM, evening study begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the hours pass, the familiar school gradually becomes something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At midnight, every light goes out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the night is not over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must continue exploring through the darkness until 6:00 AM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only then can you hope to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there is still a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A STORY HIDDEN IN THE ANOMALIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The strange things you encounter are not random.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the school, you will begin to witness fragments of another story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series of memories that should have been forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the school remembers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classrooms remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And perhaps, someone is still waiting for you to remember too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5003700/extras/e594977f9235b8bed022f3333c8d59a0.avif?t=1787206611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5003700/extras_big/e594977f9235b8bed022f3333c8d59a0.avif?t=1787206611 width=1560 height=1082 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explore a mysterious school through a first-person perspective</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Carefully observe your surroundings and identify anomalies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Make decisions based on what has changed — and what should not have changed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Choose the correct path to continue your journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Make the wrong choice and return to the beginning</p><p class=\"bb_p